<h3>acp.el and shell-maker</h3>
<p><code>agent-shell</code> stands on <a href="https://github.com/xenodium/acp.el">acp.el</a> to speak ACP and <a href="https://github.com/xenodium/shell-maker">shell-maker</a> for its shell foundations, so fixes landing there reach you just the same:</p>
